# A developer's local repo-root qaops.yaml (e.g. provider: openrouter for manual
# runs) must never be committed - it would make production accidentally depend on
# it (ADR-033, spec section: QAOps configuration). Production configures the
# pipeline via QAOPS_* environment variables instead.
